payload.core_explanation_md:
If a company has a **director** (other than a **nominee director** of a government or financial institution put on at the time of distress) whose name appears **more than once** in the **list of wilful defaulters**:

- the provision on its **standard** accounts is **5 per cent**;
- if the account becomes an **NPA**, it attracts **accelerated provisioning**, at higher rates than the regular ones.
